Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.94,Title,,0,0,0,,RAJASTHAN\NVILLAGE RESULTS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:35.94,Foot,,0,0,0,,Source: India TV · The Week · ThePrint\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}3,701 VS 2,181
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Rajasthan's village and district councils have handed the Congress a big lead over the B J P.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.45,0:00:12.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}These are the panchayat samiti, or block councils, and the zila parishad, or district councils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:20.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In block councils, Congress won about three thousand seven hundred seats, and the B J P about two thousand one hundred and eighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:27.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In district councils, Congress won five hundred and ninety nine seats, the B J P three hundred and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:31.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Counting took place in thirty seven of forty one districts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:35.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Tallies were still moving, and a later count showed slightly higher numbers for both.
